    <!-- About Screen -->
    <string name="version_label">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_tagline">Ultra lightweight and high-performance ad-blocking browser built on Android System WebView.</string>
    <string name="about_features_title">Key Features</string>
    <string name="about_feature1_title">🛡 Brave adblock-rust Engine &amp; uBO Lists</string>
    <string name="about_feature1_desc">JNI-embedded high-speed adblock engine powered by uBlock Origin base, badware, privacy, EasyList, and AdGuard filter lists.</string>
    <string name="about_feature2_title">⚡ Pure Host Fast Path</string>
    <string name="about_feature2_desc">73.7%% of rules are checked on 64-bit FNV-1a sorted arrays via binary search with 0 JNI overhead in milliseconds.</string>
    <string name="about_feature3_title">🪶 1 GB RAM Low-Memory Architecture</string>
    <string name="about_feature3_desc">Single live WebView policy, serialized engine.bin filter cache, and lock-free DecisionCache for fluid low-RAM experience.</string>
    <string name="about_feature4_title">🎨 Native CSS &amp; 1x1 GIF Interception</string>
    <string name="about_feature4_desc">Cosmetic CSS delivered directly as &lt;link&gt; stylesheet bypassing V8 JS string allocations; 1x1 transparent GIFs prevent layout shifts.</string>
    <string name="about_feature5_title">🔒 Advanced Privacy &amp; Pre-warming</string>
    <string name="about_feature5_desc">Third-party cookie blocking, Do Not Track (DNT) &amp; Sec-GPC support. SQLite DB and WebView provider pre-warmed off main thread on startup.</string>

